  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KawiSafi Ventures Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KawiSafi Ventures Fund is designed to finance early-stage small to medium-sized enterprises
(SMEs) with core business models that address the off-grid solar ecosystems in East Africa. 

&#x2022; It provides a universal access to energy to people located beyond the foreseeable grid connection and at the bottom of the economic pyramid.
&#x2022; GCF can play an important role in mobilizing private investors at scale for investment in SMEs promoting off-grid solar systems in East Africa.
&#x2022; GCF participation as an early anchor investor would instill confidence in the Program among potential investors that otherwise would not have participated in the Program.</narrative>
  </description>
